WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:06.049
A much-loved cartoon gets a modern reboot,
an Oscar-winning superhero movie gets a sequel,

00:00:06.049 --> 00:00:08.940
and Kraven the Hunter is getting his own movie?

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.737
These are the Marvel projects coming in 2023.

00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:16.299
"Moon Girl and Devil Dinosaur" has been in
development since 2019, when it was officially

00:00:16.299 --> 00:00:18.199
announced during D23.

00:00:18.199 --> 00:00:22.349
The animated series adaptation is produced
by Disney Television Animation in partnership

00:00:22.349 --> 00:00:27.449
with Marvel Animation, with Oscar nominee
Laurence Fishburne attached as co-creator

00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:29.359
and executive producer.

00:00:29.359 --> 00:00:34.700
Set for a February 10 debut on Disney Channel
and Disney+, the 2023 series will be led by

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:40.920
Diamond White as Lunella Lafayette aka Moon
Girl, Fred Tatasciore as Devil Dinosaur, Alfre

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:46.010
Woodard as Lunella's grandmother Mimi, and
Fishburne as a mischievous trickster called

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:47.380
the Beyonder.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.980
According to the show's official synopsis,
the animated series will be following the

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:56.680
adventures of Lunella Lafayette, a 13-year-old
super-genius who accidentally brings a T-Rex

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:00.640
named Devil Dinosaur into present-day New
York City through a time vortex.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:05.227
Together, they must protect the residents
of the Lower East Side from any potential danger.

00:01:05.227 --> 00:01:08.099
"All you need to know is that I'm a superhero."

00:01:08.231 --> 00:01:14.040
Starting off the MCU's Phase 5, "Ant-Man and
the Wasp: Quantumania" will once again find

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:18.729
Peyton Reed directing the third installment
of the Paul Rudd-led superhero franchise.

00:01:18.729 --> 00:01:23.980
The threequel is currently scheduled for a
February 17, 2023 release, with all the major

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:26.110
players returning for their roles.

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:30.020
After appearing in "Endgame," the film will
also reintroduce Scott's teenage daughter,

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:31.020
Cassie Lang.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.200
Not only does it appear that Cassie will be
getting her own supersuit this time around,

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:37.670
but now, she'll be portrayed by "Freaky" star
Kathryn Newton.

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:42.290
The new film will also feature the live-action
debuts of major Marvel villains in the form

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:47.439
of M.O.D.O.K. and Kang the Conqueror, who
will be portrayed by Jonathan Majors.

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:51.290
Comedy legend Bill Murray will also play Lord
Krylar in the film.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.741
Following the release of the official trailer,
it's been revealed that "The Good Place" actor

00:01:54.741 --> 00:01:57.909
William Jackson Harper has joined the ensemble
cast.

00:01:57.909 --> 00:02:02.320
As seen in the trailer, Scott, Hope, and Cassie
— along with Hope's parents Hank Pym and

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:06.969
Janet Van Dyne — get accidentally transported
into the Quantum Realm after an invention

00:02:06.969 --> 00:02:08.560
of Cassie's malfunctions.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:12.650
Together, they'll embark on an adventure through
the Quantum Realm where they'll meet strange

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.560
new creatures as a secret universe gets revealed.

00:02:15.854 --> 00:02:22.590
Nick Fury will finally be getting a starring
role in the MCU courtesy of the upcoming Secret

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:23.950
Invasion series.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:29.010
Fury made his first iconic appearance all
the way back in 2008's Iron Man when he showed

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:30.491
up in a post-credits scene

00:02:30.491 --> 00:02:32.936
"I'm here to talk to you about the Avengers
initiative."

00:02:32.936 --> 00:02:38.390
Since then, Nick Fury has been a constant
thread tying the many separate MCU storylines

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:42.590
together, playing pivotal roles in a number
of films from "Captain America: The Winter

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:46.000
Soldier" to "Spider-Man: Far From Home" to
"Captain Marvel."

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.620
In December of 2020, Disney announced at their
Investor Day event that the Nick Fury series

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:55.640
will actually be an adaptation of the popular
"Secret Invasion" storyline from the comics.

00:02:55.640 --> 00:03:00.690
"Secret Invasion" is set to be a crossover
event, bringing together characters from across

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:02.650
numerous MCU properties.

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:06.519
The storyline in the comics centers around
an invasion of the Skrulls, who have already

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:11.000
popped up in the MCU in a decidedly more sympathetic
role than their comics counterparts.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:15.720
In the comics, the shape-shifting Skrulls
have secretly invaded Earth, taking the place

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.770
of some of Marvel's heroes.

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:22.371
Naturally, Samuel Jackson is set to reprise
his role as Fury in "Secret Invasion," along

00:03:22.371 --> 00:03:27.260
with Cobie Smulders as Maria Hill, Martin
Freeman as CIA operative Everett K. Ross,

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:32.894
Don Cheadle as War Machine, and Ben Mendelsohn
returning as Talos, his character from "Captain Marvel."

00:03:32.894 --> 00:03:38.651
Olivia Colman, Emilia Clark and Christopher
McDonald will also be joining the star-studded cast.

00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:42.761
As for the behind-the-scenes talent, Kyle
Bradstreet — who's best known for his work

00:03:42.761 --> 00:03:48.112
on the Emmy-winning series "Mr. Robot" — will
serve as writer and executive producer.

00:03:48.416 --> 00:03:52.760
After briefly appearing in "Thor: Love and
Thunder," the Guardians of the Galaxy will

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:59.330
return on May 5, 2023 with their third and
reportedly final installment.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:04.280
James Gunn is officially back as writer and
director with all of the main Guardians returning

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.900
for one last ride.

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:11.420
"Vol. 3" will also feature the long-awaited
live-action debut of the powerful Adam Warlock,

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.170
portrayed by Will Poulter.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:17.139
Warlock's involvement was first teased during
the post-credits scene of "Vol. 2," where

00:04:17.139 --> 00:04:20.090
he was created for the purpose of destroying
the Guardians.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:24.183
"That, my child, is the next step in our evolution."

00:04:24.183 --> 00:04:29.020
Arguably the most intriguing addition to the
cast is "Peacemaker" actor Chukwudi Iwuji

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:32.010
who has been tapped to play the villainous
High Evolutionary.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:36.880
As for the plot, Marvel.com says Peter Quill
will lead his team in another universe-saving

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.900
mission, while also trying to protect one
of their own members.

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:44.090
We also know Gamora will have teamed up with
the Ravagers and won't have any memory of

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:49.076
her relationship with Star-Lord, and we'll
be getting a lot of Rocket Raccoon's tragic backstory.

00:04:49.076 --> 00:04:53.680
Previously, Gunn has hinted that "Guardians
of the Galaxy Vol. 3" will be a darker, more

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:57.690
emotional journey for the space-travelling
team and that it will be the last time we

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.755
see this iteration of the Guardians.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:05.620
Winner of the Academy Award for Best Animated
Feature of 2018, "Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse"

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:11.060
is considered by some to be among the greatest
superhero films ever made, thanks in large

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:14.259
part to its supremely innovative animation
style.

00:05:14.259 --> 00:05:18.389
We'll see if Sony can capture lightning in
a bottle twice with "Spider-Man: Across the

00:05:18.389 --> 00:05:22.290
Spider-Verse" which will center on the burgeoning
romantic relationship between Miles Morales

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:25.759
and Gwen Stacy, aka Spider-Gwen.

00:05:25.759 --> 00:05:31.819
Joining Miles and Gwen for the sequel will
be Spider-Man 2099 hero Miguel O'Hara, voiced

00:05:31.819 --> 00:05:37.190
by "Moon Knight" star Oscar Isaac, and Jessica
Drew, aka Spider-Woman, who will be voiced

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.890
by "Insecure" star Issa Rae.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:44.690
Oscar-winner Daniel Kaluuya will play Hobie
Brown, aka Spider-Punk, and Jake Johnson will

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:46.900
reprise his role of Peter B. Parker.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:50.660
They'll be facing off against the Spot, played
by Jason Schwartzman.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:54.250
"Across the Spider-Verse" will hit theaters
on June 2, 2023.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:06:00.469
Its sequel, "Beyond the Spider-Verse," will
hit the big screen on March 29, 2024.

00:06:00.582 --> 00:06:05.270
While Marvel is keeping quiet so far about
what Carol Danvers will be up to the next

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:08.270
time we see her, we do know that she won't
be alone.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:13.290
The film that was originally presented as
a sequel to 2019's "Captain Marvel" was revealed

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:17.550
in 2021 to actually be a team-up feature titled
"The Marvels."

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:22.020
Brie Larson will be returning as Carol Danvers,
aka Captain Marvel, but joining her this time

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:26.160
around will be Teyonah Parris, who was introduced
in "WandaVision" as a grown-up version of

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:32.310
Monica Rambeau, and Iman Vellani, who burst
onto Disney+ as Carol Danvers' #1 fangirl,

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:34.729
Kamala Khan, aka Ms. Marvel.

00:06:34.729 --> 00:06:39.430
As the only character in the trio without
"Marvel" in her name, the title of "The Marvels"

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:44.259
suggests that Monica Rambeau will see her
fully embracing her identity as a superhero.

00:06:44.259 --> 00:06:50.250
The comics have seen her take a number of
names, including Photon, Spectrum, and even

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:55.110
Meanwhile, Kamala Khan unlocked her own superpowers
after finding a mystical bangle, fighting

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:59.680
the Clandestines, connecting with both her
culture and her family, and discovering she's

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:06.000
both a djinn and a mutant — all before accidentally
swapping places with her idol, Carol Danvers.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:09.740
As for the plot, we know the film will pick
up immediately after "Ms. Marvel," but the

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.389
specifics are being kept under wraps for now.

00:07:12.389 --> 00:07:17.139
"The Marvels" will be helmed by "Candyman"
director Nia DaCosta, and will be soaring

00:07:17.139 --> 00:07:20.356
into theaters on July 28, 2023.

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:26.610
Marvel's Disney+ series "Loki" was full of
surprises, not the least of which was that

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.830
the show will be getting a second season.

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:33.370
The first season of "Loki" saw the trickster
god apprehended by the Time Variance Authority

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:37.930
thanks to his actions in "Avengers: Endgame,"
where he deviated from the original timeline

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:42.370
by stealing the Tesseract and escaping instead
of being transported back to Asgard to be

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:43.890
tried for his crimes.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:49.139
Once at the TVA, he teamed up with Agent Mobius
and another Loki variant named Sylvie to uncover

00:07:49.139 --> 00:07:51.789
the secrets behind the time-controlling agency.

00:07:51.789 --> 00:07:56.360
The first season ended with the introduction
of He Who Remains, who promised his even more

00:07:56.360 --> 00:08:00.479
dangerous variant — Kang the Conqueror — would
be appearing soon.

00:08:00.479 --> 00:08:05.259
We know Majors as Kang will first be appearing
in "Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania," and

00:08:05.259 --> 00:08:08.360
that he'll definitely be a factor in "Loki"
Season 2.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:12.840
The finale also stranded Loki in an alternate
dimension TVA where no one knew him.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:17.310
The returning cast will be joined by someone
who's a Marvel rookie but a multiverse veteran

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:20.699
– Ke Huy Quan of "Everything Everywhere
All At Once" fame.

00:08:20.699 --> 00:08:24.740
It's also been reported that Kate Dickie of
"Game of Thrones" will allegedly be playing

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:25.740
a villain.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:29.509
However, whenever "Loki" does return, it will
be in the hands of new directors.

00:08:29.509 --> 00:08:34.140
Season 1 director Kate Herron will be replaced
by Justin Benson and Aaron Moorhead.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:38.390
In addition to critically acclaimed films
like "Spring," "The Endless," and "Synchronic,"

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:43.919
the duo has previously worked on "Moon Knight,"
which is what reportedly landed them the "Loki" gig.

00:08:43.919 --> 00:08:48.399
Among the more interesting projects Sony has
planned for their Spidey-centric universe

00:08:48.399 --> 00:08:53.980
is a solo vehicle starring the classic villain
Sergei Kravinoff, aka Kraven the Hunter.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:58.640
Descended from an aristocratic Russian bloodline,
Kravinoff has dedicated his life to becoming

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:05.310
the world's greatest hunter, and no quarry
has ever stoked his obsession quite like Spider-Man.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:09.149
While we're unsure of the plot, we know the
screenplay will be penned by "The Equalizer

00:09:09.149 --> 00:09:13.440
2" scribe Richard Wenk and screenwriting duo
Art Marcum and Matt Holloway.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:18.121
MCU veteran Aaron Taylor-Johnson, who portrayed
the ill-fated Quicksilver in "Avengers: Age

00:09:18.121 --> 00:09:21.631
of Ultron”, will be taking on the lead role
as Kraven the Hunter.

00:09:21.631 --> 00:09:23.441
"Didn't see that coming."

00:09:23.441 --> 00:09:28.180
In addition to the solo film, Taylor-Johnson
reportedly signed on for appearances in multiple

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:33.020
other movies as well, indicating that the
Kraven film is likely to be just the beginning

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:35.840
of the character's arc in the Sony Spider-verse.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:40.149
Joining Taylor-Johnson in "Kraven the Hunter"
will be Oscar nominee Ariana DeBose as the

00:09:40.149 --> 00:09:45.329
voodoo priestess, and possible Kraven love
interest, Calypso, Fred Hechinger as Kraven's

00:09:45.329 --> 00:09:49.550
half-brother Chameleon, and Christopher Abbott
as the mercenary assassin the Foreigner, who

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:51.269
will act as the film's villain.

00:09:51.269 --> 00:09:56.200
Oscar winner Russell Crowe, who made his MCU
debut as Zeus in "Thor: Love and Thunder,"

00:09:56.200 --> 00:10:01.251
will also be appearing in the film in an undisclosed
role, as will Levi Miller and Alessandro Nivola.

00:10:01.251 --> 00:10:06.079
"Kraven the Hunter" will be helmed by "Triple
Frontier" director J.C. Chandor, and is scheduled

00:10:06.079 --> 00:10:08.802
to hit theaters October 6, 2023.

00:10:09.051 --> 00:10:16.020
Mutant fans, get excited for "X-Men '97,"
a revival of the popular '90s animated series.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:20.890
This marks Marvel Studio's first confirmed
X-Men-centered project, which is currently

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:24.700
slated for the fall of 2023 with 10 episodes.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:29.399
It hails from head writer/executive producer
Beau DeMayo, who's previously worked on "The

00:10:29.399 --> 00:10:30.450
Witcher" and "Moon Knight."

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.750
And the creative team behind the original
show — director Larry Houston and showrunners

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:38.200
Eric and Julia Lewald — will be consulting
on the series.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:44.139
Along with a cast of newcomers, "X-Men '97"
will feature the return of the original voice cast.

00:10:44.139 --> 00:10:48.510
Some are set to reprise their roles from the
original series, while others have been tapped

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:49.770
for new characters.

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:55.320
Images of first-look concept art have confirmed
the appearances of Wolverine, Rogue, Gambit,

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:59.650
Cyclops, Jubilee, Storm, Jean Grey, and Beast.

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:05.420
Ahead of its long-awaited debut, it's also
been announced that "X-Men '97" will be receiving

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.250
a second season.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:13.589
In a surprising and delightful announcement
in October 2021, Marvel revealed that a "WandaVision"

00:11:13.589 --> 00:11:18.570
spinoff starring Kathryn Hahn's witchy Agatha
Harkness was in the works for Disney+.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:22.650
In "WandaVision," Hahn spent the first half
of the series playing Wanda and Vision's nosy

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:26.190
neighbor Agnes, who played along with Wanda's
sitcom scenarios.

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:32.150
However, it was ultimately revealed that Agnes
was actually a centuries-old witch named Agatha

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:38.000
Harkness who'd been secretly pulling strings
behind the scenes of Wanda's picture-perfect,

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:38.672
TV-ready town.

00:11:38.672 --> 00:11:41.282
"Lovely to finally meet you."

00:11:41.282 --> 00:11:47.149
While in the comics, Agatha was a wise, elderly
witch who even served as a magical mentor

00:11:47.149 --> 00:11:52.480
to Wanda for a time, in the MCU, Agatha is
an ambitious and power-hungry villain who

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:58.050
absorbed the power of her coven and has used
it to sustain herself for centuries.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:02.380
After a sky-high showdown with Wanda in the
"WandaVision" finale, Agatha was ultimately

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:07.630
trapped by the Scarlet Witch inside Westview,
her mind altered to lock her in her Agnes

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:12.120
persona, even as Wanda released the rest of
the town's residents.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:16.670
Marvel hasn't yet announced whether the Agatha
series will take place prior to Agatha's adventures

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:22.430
in Westview or pick up sometime later, presumably
after she's managed to shake off Wanda's enchantment

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:23.990
and regain her powers.

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:29.560
However, we suspect the latter, as Emma Caulfield
Ford will reprise her role as Westview resident

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:35.070
Dottie and Debra Jo Rupp will return as well,
most likely as Mrs. Hart from "WandaVision."

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:39.200
Deadline has reported that Aubrey Plaza of
"Parks and Recreation" fame is set to join

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:41.980
the show, possibly as the villain of the series.

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:46.820
Jac Schaeffer of "WandaVision" fame will serve
as showrunner, and we also expect things to

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.260
get musical.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.880
Kathryn Hahn said to TV Line,

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:53.669
"Who knows, there may be a little song here
or there ... but no one is saying about that

00:12:53.669 --> 00:12:54.890
— certainly not me!"

00:12:55.184 --> 00:13:00.060
In addition to returning as the director for
the untitled "Shang-Chi” sequel and “Avengers:

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:04.459
The Kang Dynasty”, Destin Daniel Cretton's
newest deal with Marvel Studios includes the

00:13:04.459 --> 00:13:10.648
development of a brand new MCU series, which
was previously speculated as a "Shang-Chi" spinoff.

00:13:10.648 --> 00:13:15.030
However, according to The Hollywood Reporter,
Cretton's secret MCU project is actually a

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:20.260
live-action TV adaptation of "Wonder Man,"
a Marvel superhero created by Stan Lee, Don

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.870
Heck, and Jack Kirby.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:26.480
Wonder Man, aka Simon Williams, is known as
one of Marvel's oldest heroes.

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:30.980
In the comics, Simon is a celebrity by day
and a superhero by night.

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:35.440
He gained his powers through an ionic energy
experiment done by Baron Zemo, allowing him

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:41.730
to have superhuman abilities such as strength,
speed, agility, durability, and more.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:45.630
Joining Cretton in developing the Disney+
series is "Brooklyn Nine-Nine" producer Andrew

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.690
Guest, who will serve as the head writer.

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:52.850
Meanwhile, Cretton is expected to executive
produce and direct one or multiple episodes.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:57.290
The outlet notes that the project is still
in the early stages of development and might

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:59.940
potentially start filming in 2023.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:04.980
Even before the "Wonder Man" series was confirmed,
speculation about the hero's potential MCU

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:09.380
debut was stoked after fans spotted a picture
of Wonder Man in one of the behind-the-scenes

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:11.000
featurettes for "WandaVision."

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:15.680
Given the hero's history with Wanda Maximoff,
it's likely that Marvel Studios might have

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:18.500
initially planned to include Wonder Man in
the series.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:22.370
In the comics, the character is also closely
linked with Vision, so it's always possible

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:26.160
that Paul Bettany's new White Vision might
show up soon.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:30.230
Whether or not Vision appears, we do know
who will be playing the titular character

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:36.339
— the one and only Yahya Abdul-Mateen II,
who's appeared in major projects like "Aquaman,"

00:14:36.339 --> 00:14:39.170
"The Matrix Resurrections," and "The Get Down."

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:43.320
We also know that at least one memorable MCU
character is making his return.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:48.870
According to Variety, Sir Ben Kingsley will
be reprising his role as the lovable if troublesome

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:50.560
thespian Trevor Slattery.

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:54.600
We last saw Trevor in "Shang-Chi," where he
accompanied the titular hero into the magical

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:55.709
realm of Ta Lo.

00:14:55.709 --> 00:15:00.630
It makes sense that Trevor would be returning
here as both he and Simon Williams are actors,

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:03.450
and it also marks Kingsley's reunion with
Cretton.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:09.120
As the casts for the various Disney+ MCU shows
continue to be fleshed out, doors are opening

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:12.620
for other series featuring some of these new
characters.

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:16.920
Such is the case with a new series centered
around the character of Echo, who was introduced

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.660
in 2021's "Hawkeye."

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:23.700
In the comics, Maya Lopez, aka Echo, is a
deaf Native American woman who's raised by

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:26.910
the villainous Kingpin after he kills her
father.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:31.890
Echo has the ability to perfectly mimic other
people's movements, similar to Taskmaster.

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:36.529
She's also an accomplished athlete and acrobat,
as well as an expert markswoman.

00:15:36.529 --> 00:15:40.709
In "Hawkeye," Echo is played by newcomer Alaqua
Cox, where she's a high-ranking member of

00:15:40.709 --> 00:15:44.759
the Tracksuit Mafia seeking vengeance against
Clint Barton's alter ego, Ronin.

00:15:44.759 --> 00:15:49.040
Her backstory in the series remained largely
the same as in the comics, including her close

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:54.190
relationship with Vincent D'Onofrio's Kingpin,
who was first introduced to audiences in Netflix's

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:55.600
"Daredevil" series.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:59.639
Although Echo appeared to have killed Kingpin
in the final episode of "Hawkeye," The Hollywood

00:15:59.639 --> 00:16:03.620
Reporter has announced that the crime lord
will return for Maya's upcoming series.

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:08.759
Plus, we'll also see Charlie Cox reprising
his role as Daredevil, who's a close associate

00:16:08.759 --> 00:16:10.250
of Echo's in the comics.

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:13.980
There are also rumors that Krysten Ritter's
Jessica Jones will appear as well.

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:18.994
Deadline has also reported that Devery Jacobs
of "Reservation Dogs" will be playing a lead character.

00:16:18.994 --> 00:16:24.250
Also rumored to be joining Alaqua Cox in an
undisclosed role is celebrated actor Graham

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:29.360
Greene, who received an Academy Award nomination
for his performance in "Dances With Wolves"

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:34.540
and previously starred alongside MCU actors
Jeremy Renner and Elizabeth Olsen in 2017's

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:35.540
"Wind River."

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:39.860
Filling up the cast with more Indigenous actors
lines up with reports that the show will see

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:44.210
Maya go back to her hometown to reconnect
with her Native American roots.

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:48.740
Echo's comics storylines also significantly
intersect with Moon Knight's, who led his

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:50.230
own Disney+ show.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:53.839
Additionally, in the comics, Echo was the
first person to carry the mantle of Ronin

00:16:53.839 --> 00:16:58.329
before Clint Barton took it over — although
in the MCU, Barton was the original vigilante,

00:16:58.329 --> 00:17:01.209
whose actions directly impacted Maya Lopez's
life.

00:17:01.209 --> 00:17:05.310
We don't yet know if these comics details
will make an appearance in the show.

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:10.390
The showrunner for the series is Marion Dayre,
who's also worked on "Better Call Saul," "Shantaram,"

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:11.400
and "The Act."

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:15.699
Speaking with the "Writers Panel" podcast,
Dayre revealed the show wouldn't hit Disney+

00:17:15.699 --> 00:17:18.135
until December 2023.

